{"reviews":[{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-0","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect!","x":"I just use these for my eyebrows. The bristles are soft, yet firm. They brush out my brows perfectly and the size is perfect for my small hands. You can also bend and shape the brush to your liking. Perfect for makeup application and brushing out your brows or lashes!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-1","r":5.0,"t":"Work great!","x":"These are great. I use them after I apply my mascara to get rid of any clumps. The bristles are firm but not too firm. The price is great for the value. I would definitely buy them again. They work perfectly.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-2","r":5.0,"t":"Staple for all makeup lovers","x":"These spoolies are great. Perfect for removing mascara clumps after application. Great at apply coconut oil to lashes.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-3","r":5.0,"t":"Good for the value","x":"I use these when I do eyebrows at the salon, the brush is a dense thick brush","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-4","r":4.0,"t":"Pretty good for price and what they will be used for","x":"Pretty decent. Much shorter than I expected. The brush head though, is pretty dense and the bristles are soft.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-5","r":4.0,"t":"They get the job done, but are not soft/gentle","x":"I bought these in order to apply oil to my lashes at night. These brushes are a good value, but just be aware that they are quite stiff--especially at the end point. Nevertheless, they work for what I need.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-6","r":5.0,"t":"Best lash brush ever","x":"I  use this product on my eyelashes after I put mascara on. This product is wonderful to making my lashes look longer and fuller. I would recommend this to anyone who uses mascara.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-7","r":4.0,"t":"Yeah they work","x":"Not much to say about them they\u2019re just the cheap mascara wands. I use them to brush my eyebrows out and apply vitamin e oil to them/my eyelashes.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great value","x":"Great value. I use it for applying mascara that the old brushes are caked. makes my lashes look natural and not clumpy,","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-9","r":5.0,"t":"Must buy!","x":"So dense and soft. Perfect for eyelashes and eyebrows.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-10","r":5.0,"t":"Why didn't I get these sooner?","x":"I used to have to throw away masacara when it was still half full because it got so clumpy and I couldn't get the brush clean enough. Now I can use it all the way to the bottom because I use these disposable brushes. I use the regular brush, then go over lashes with a brand new clean one of these and it take the clumps right out.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great buy","x":"This package came in super quick, said it would take almost a week, but it only took 2 days!! The spoolies are very sturdy, not as flimsy as the ones you would regularly see in sephora or ulta. the packaging was very pretty also, would definitely purchase again when i run out!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-12","r":5.0,"t":"Great value!","x":"I don't like eyebrow gels but my eyebrows never stay in place so these are perfect for brushing them into place. I really like how many it comes with because I always end up losing them around my house/in my purse so now I always have another one on hand when needed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-13","r":5.0,"t":"I would recommend.","x":"I got these brushes to apply castor oil to my lashes. Out of all the items I bought that day, it was the first one to arrive. The quality is nice. They\u2019re sturdy, even after bending, and soft enough that I can massage the castor oil with the brush itself.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-14","r":5.0,"t":"Better than expected","x":"These mascara brushes exceeded my expectations!  They are sturdy, and the brush part is a nice size.  I mainly use them for separating my lashes after applying mascara.  Lot of bang for your buck!  You won't be disappointed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-15","r":5.0,"t":"mascara ++ purchase","x":"I originally got these as disposable eyebrushes, but have used them repeatingly as various handy cleaners:  Like, cleaning my eyeglass frames & nosepads, electric shaver heads.  They work real well cleaning small crevices.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-16","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"Just what I needed. Lifetime contact lense werer here with a recent eye infection.  I found a need to not contaminate my mascara that I would rather not go without.  These are great! Highly recommend!. Awesome price too.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-17","r":5.0,"t":"Very Convenient!","x":"Very happy with this purchase, I use it to brush my brows after applying brow products.  I apply makeup everyday so if I only use one spoolie it gets very dirty very quickly. Very glad to have so many to spare!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-18","r":5.0,"t":"Great harmonica cleaner!","x":"These are the perfect item for cleaning out the holes in harmonicas, able to reach inside to remove gunk far better than the toothbrushes many use which only clean the surface of the harmonica's comb.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-19","r":5.0,"t":"Sturdy!","x":"Can't complain these are high quality which I didn't expect! I'm an esthetician and use these for brow waxes and lash extensions. They're sturdy and work great for me and my business.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great Choice","x":"I am always going through mascara wands especially for lashes and eyebrow waxing. It is nice that I do not have to spend a lot to stock up with all the deals her on amazon.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-21","r":5.0,"t":"Very Versatile","x":"I use the disposable brushes for several things such as brushing out any mascara globs, combing my eyebrows, to sharing mascara without sharing my brush!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great for my use and not make up","x":"I needed something to use to clean sewing machines.  Cotton swabs leave debris behind and the brushes  get the dirt out and leave nothing behind","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-23","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE this ring!","x":"works for last minute eyebrow touches and if you don't like a certain wand that comes with your mascara go a head and try it with these","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07DT5FHY4-24","r":4.0,"t":"They\u2019re pretty good","x":"They are good and get the job done but I assumed they were the big ones. My fault though. You can never have enough of these anyway.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find these spoolies great for separating lashes and removing mascara clumps after application.","cites":[2,3,7,9,11,15]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the value and quantity for the price.","cites":[2,4,5,6,9,13,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers use them for eyebrows and for applying oils to lashes and brows.","cites":[1,3,6,8,13,14]},{"text":"Opinions on bristles vary: some describe them as soft and dense, while others find them stiff or not gentle.","cites":[1,5,6,10,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the brushes are sturdy and hold up well, even when bent.","cites":[12,14,15]}]},"qa":[]}